		{ String _name = "DSCoalBellPit1Tip";			String _text = "A primitive Coal mine, built on flat ground, requires 3-8 miners who will extract Coal only from a 'bell' shaped pit in the ground. It has a limited production (600) and will become derelict afterwards. The mine requires 34 work to build."; }
